; A block whose passage (LRUD) line comes before its *calibrate declination.
; The passage line reads no bearing, so every bearing takes the one value.
*begin lrud
*date 2020.06.01
*fix a 0 0 0
*data passage station left right up down
a 1 1 1 1
*data normal from to tape compass clino
*calibrate declination 2
a b 10.0 0 0
b c 8.5 90 0
*end lrud
